<title>POLAND: Polisa Q4 net rises to PLN 3.5 mln.</title>
<headline>Polisa Q4 net rises to PLN 3.5 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polisa results for the fourth quarter ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q4 1996     Q4 1995</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			  4.93  vs    3.88</p>
<p>    net profit				3.50  vs    2.53</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Polisa SA.</p>
<p>    gross premium			  57.23  vs   36.37</p>
<p>    reinsurers share of premiums     20.21  vs    5.04</p>
<p>    extraordinary loss		    0.02  vs    0.01</p>
<p>    gross claims and benefits	  30.38  vs   15.85</p>
<p>    reinsurers share in claims	 17.78  vs   17.46</p>
<p>    technical result			3.95  vs    5.74</p>
<p>    revenues from investments	   0.98  vs    0.04</p>
<p>    cost of investments		   0.18  vs    1.04</p>
<p>    income tax				1.44  vs    1.35</p>
<p>JANUARY-DECEMBER</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			  5.17  vs    3.91</p>
<p>    net profit				3.72  vs    2.55</p>
<p>    gross premium			 197.93  vs  123.10</p>
<p>    reinsurers share of premiums     76.55  vs   16.80</p>
<p>    extraordinary loss		    0.03  vs    0.02</p>
<p>    gross claims and benefits	 102.65  vs   61.20</p>
<p>    reinsurers share in claims	 49.48  vs   19.35</p>
<p>    technical result			1.97  vs    5.58</p>
<p>    revenues from investments	   3.89  vs    0.60</p>
<p>    cost of investments		   0.53  vs    1.12</p>
<p>    income tax				1.46  vs    1.36</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
